//
// Inter-service gRPC contract for the Content Consumption core domain
// (chora_consumption database, Team 1 / Content). Surface: A+ Reader mode.
//
// Aggregates exposed:
//   - LearningPath        — ordered/queried sequence of atoms (Straight-Up
//                           linear cert mode + Discovery curiosity mode)
//   - AtomicSession       — learner's session over a single atom
//   - Companion            — RPG learning companion DOMAIN ENTITY (NOT the
//                           AI agent that powers it — the agent is in
//                           AI Kernel; this is the domain-side entity)
//   - DailyDose           — Ebbinghaus-curve spaced repetition pull-list
//
// Companion discipline (per CLAUDE.md domain vocabulary): Companion is the
// in-game RPG companion (a domain entity in Content Consumption); the AI
// agent powering it is a separate adapter concern (in AI Kernel). Don't
// conflate.
//
// Cross-DB queries FORBIDDEN — atom content is OWNED by Creation; this
// service consumes Pub/Sub-fed projections (see chora.creation.atom.* events).
//
// Learner-facing reads use GraphQL (chora-contracts/graphql/consumption.graphql).
// gRPC is for internal service-to-service sync calls only.
//
// Deployed in chora-content (Team 1 pool). mTLS via Cloud Service Mesh;
// SPIFFE identity in mesh; W3C trace context in gRPC metadata.
// =============================================================================

